  "definition": "Annual Fee for Services",
  "effectiveDate": "2018-08-23",
  "historyNote": "#9029, eff 11-17-07; renumbered by #9206 (formerly He-W 405.02); ss by #10955, eff 10-22-15; amd by #12612, eff 8-23-18",
